   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Pika H3 Flex + Dials \u2014 MiniMax H3, 6 steps**\n\nPika H3 Flex is a 6-step, no-CFG LoRA for MiniMax H3. Keep the **lcm** sampler and the **6-step schedule** as they are; the motion dial sits between the LoRA and the sampler. Size: 1280x704 (about 0.9 MP).\n\n**Motion dial on Pika** (1280x704, spellblade prompt, seed 42, one take per strength; camera-removed optical flow):\n- **+0.5**: +20 % motion, same scene.\n- **+1.0**: +23 %, still the same scene.\n- **+1.5 / +2.0**: about +90 %; the scene restages and characters morph.\n- **+3**: loses the prompt.\n\n**Evil** (off at 0): dread +0.5 to +1 darkens the scene and turns the characters menacing while keeping the prompt. Other flavours: pick another `h3_evil_*` file.\n\n**No background music:** write `non_diegetic_music: N/A` (Pika's prompt guide).\n\n**Models:** the LoRA is `loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` in [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) (same weights as [Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex](https://huggingface.co/Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex) `comfy/loras/`). Base model, text encoder and VAEs as in the other Dials workflows."
   ]
  }
